 personal safety at TCU. Additionally, this report outlines fire safety systems, policies and procedures for on-campus housing facilities, as well as residence hall fire statistics. The Annual Security Report and Fire Safety Report can be found on the TCU Police Department website at https://police.tcu.edu/annual-security-report , or a paper copy of the report may be obtained by contacting the TCU Police Department at 817-257-7930, or via email at police@tcu.edu . Sign Up for Job Alerts! Job Alert 11c111c3 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Adjunct Faculty Adjunct Faculty Employment Type Temporary Temporary First Name (required) 0b723410 Last Name (required) 29a0d85b Email (required) 339fb85e Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you! Want to Share This Job? First Name (required) 38b329e5 Last Name (required) 2815bd9a Email (required) 8f372720 Who would you like to share this with? 10e7dd71 Send Please wait... Done Not You? We've sent an email! Recently Posted Jobs Assistant Director of Contract Administration Operations Finance & Administration The Assistant Director of Contract Administration Operations provides contract-related guidance from a business perspective and support to the entire TCU community through all phases of contract negotiation, preparation and execution. Performs a wide range of duties related to contracts including review, revision and preparation of contracts that comply with Texas Christian University policies and procedures in advance of final review and signature. Coordinator of New Student & Family Programs Student Affairs The Coordinator, New Student & Family Programs, is responsible for collaboration with university departments to execute First Year Leadership Opportunities (FLO), service to first-year commuter students and assis